@startuml

salt
{
  <b>PUBLISH A BUNDLE</b>  { The bundle | The options | The preview | The run | The receipt }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>1 The bundle</b>
      party_essentials · Tenant · writes into the tenant that asked
      --
      {#
        Order | Dataset | Included | Staged | Published
        10 | refdata.conventions | always | 10991 | 10991
        20 | refdata.currency_pair_conventions | always | 88 | 84
        30 | refdata.currency_pair_convention_calendars | optional | 34 | 0
        40 | lei.parties | optional | 1200 | 0
      }
      <i>The order is the dependency closure's; display order breaks ties.</i>
    } | {
      <b>3 The preview</b>
      {#
        Dataset | Staged | Insert | Update | Skip
        refdata.conventions | 10991 | 0 | 0 | 10991
        refdata.currency_pair_conventions | 88 | 4 | 0 | 84
      }
      --
      <b>4 The run</b>
      step 1 done · step 2 done · step 3 halted · step 4 queued
      <i>A failed step halts the run and does not undo the steps before it.</i>
      --
      <b>5 The receipt</b>
      four counts per member, and the workflow instance
      --
      <b>What it cannot show</b>
      The history. The run log exists and nothing writes it.
    }
  }
  --
  { Back | Continue | <i>The target tenant is read from the level and never chosen.</i> }
}

@enduml
